OL,3,GNEWSAHonouring mining heritage at match
OL,4,A'was so moving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lay roses ahead of a
OL,7,Ffootball match between Sunderland and
OL,8,FFrench side RC Lens to honour their
OL,9,Fshared mining heritage has spoken about
OL,10,Fhow "moving" the entire day was.
OL,12,FSusan Proudfoot, who is originally from
OL,13,FWashington, said she was related to
OL,14,FRoxy Music frontman Bryan Ferry, whose
OL,15,Ffather looked after pit ponies at the
OL,16,Flocal colliery.
OL,18,FShe now lives in Kent and travelled to
OL,19,Fthe preseason friendly in France on 8
OL,20,FAugust for her first Sunderland match,
OL,21,Fsaying it felt like it would be "an
OL,22,Finsult not to go" as it was so close.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
