OL,3,GNEWSAHonouring mining heritage at match
OL,4,A'was so moving'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the match Proudfoot lay roses and
OL,7,Fhandwritten messages outside Stade
OL,8,FBollaert-Delelisto to celebrate the
OL,9,Fmining history of both Lens and
OL,10,Fnorth-east England.
